# Defect 290 (lane b9-notext, 2026-10-04), its surface rows (lane
# b14-harness-b, 2026-10-07, defect 328's remedy): a string literal holding
# a raw ESC, the byte itself, and `[2Jboom`. The token dump and the syntax
# tree's dump write the ESC by its code, `<U+001B>`, where they wrote the byte
# and a terminal cleared its screen. The byte stands here on purpose, so no
# editor may normalise it: `suite_surface`'s rows over this file fail if one
# does.
function main()
    print("\u{1b}[2Jboom")  #~ invisible_character
